  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. <br>• Cut beetroot into wedges. <br>• Pick and finely chop rosemary (see ingredients). <br>• Place beetroot and rosemary on a lined oven <br>tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle over savoury<br>seasoning and toss to coat. Roast until tender, <br>30-35 minutes. <br>TIP: Beetroot stays firm when cooked. It’s done when <br>you can pierce it with a fork. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709715a5a49c635d8a865f/step-72435b00.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Cut or tear bake-at-home ciabatta into <br>bite-sized chunks. <br>• When beetroot has 10 minutes remaining, place <br>croutons on a second lined oven tray, drizzle with <br>olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss <br>to coat. <br>• Spread out evenly and bake until golden, <br>5-7 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709715a5a49c635d8a865f/step-b6287b10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While croutons are baking, thinly slice pear<br>into wedges. <br>• Trim and halve green beans. <br>• Finely chop garlic.<br>• Thinly slice double cream Brie. <br>• In a small microwave-safe bowl, microwave a good <br>drizzle of oil with garlic and a pinch of chilli flakes<br>(if using) until fragrant, 30 seconds. Season to taste. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709715a5a49c635d8a865f/step-44d3a620.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Add green beans and a splash of water to a <br>large microwave-safe bowl, then cover with damp <br>paper towel.  <br>• Microwave green beans on high until just tender, <br>2-4 minutes. <br>• Drain green beans, then return to the bowl and <br>allow to cool slightly. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709715a5a49c635d8a865f/step-15709630.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To the bowl with green beans, add spinach &amp; <br>rocket mix, pear, croutons, walnuts and balsamic<br>vinaigrette dressing.  <br>• Toss to combine. Season to taste. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709715a5a49c635d8a865f/step-0966ed40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide crouton salad between bowls. Top with warm <br>beetroot and Brie. <br>• Drizzle over garlic-chilli oil to serve. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/68709715a5a49c635d8a865f/step-e4d3c150.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
